WEBVTT

01:58.920 --> 02:00.680
Hello. Where are you?

02:01.520 --> 02:03.280
We're eating
Boiled Fish with Pickled Cabbage.

02:03.360 --> 02:05.080
Okay, I'm coming.

02:05.160 --> 02:07.240
But we're with Gu Yu.

02:08.440 --> 02:10.440
Then you guys eat. I'm not going.

02:11.880 --> 02:13.080
Don't get exposed.

02:13.160 --> 02:16.360
Granny, you, and me

02:16.440 --> 02:18.480
went to the amusement park together.

02:18.560 --> 02:19.640
I left early for an emergency

02:19.720 --> 02:21.360
- on the way back.
- Granny, try the fish.

02:21.440 --> 02:22.800
Okay.

02:26.200 --> 02:27.520
Come on. Try this.

02:30.040 --> 02:32.480
You haven't told us how you found us.

02:35.680 --> 02:37.800
You said you were eating boiled fish.

02:37.880 --> 02:41.120
There were only a few
boiled fish restaurants nearby.

02:41.200 --> 02:43.840
With persistence,
I finally found this place.

02:47.040 --> 02:49.120
Why are you so persistent?

02:57.000 --> 02:58.000
Come on. Try this.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.200
Are we exposed?

03:03.320 --> 03:04.840
I'm asking you.

03:04.920 --> 03:06.600
Why are you grinning like that?

03:07.680 --> 03:10.120
A young man cares about a girl so much.

03:10.200 --> 03:11.680
What else could it be?

03:15.160 --> 03:17.040
Granny, I'm over 30 years old,

03:17.120 --> 03:18.320
not a young man anymore.

03:19.040 --> 03:21.040
In my eyes, you're both young.

03:21.120 --> 03:23.720
Granny, you got us wrong.

03:23.800 --> 03:25.280
I don't like being trapped,

03:25.360 --> 03:27.080
and neither does he, right?

03:30.880 --> 03:32.160
Yes.

03:32.240 --> 03:33.320
We can't be together.

03:34.320 --> 03:35.760
I see.

03:35.840 --> 03:37.840
It's hard for you to get married.

03:38.640 --> 03:39.640
Yes.

03:41.600 --> 03:44.280
Maybe you don't have to get married.

03:44.360 --> 03:47.240
You can keep dating like this.

04:22.960 --> 04:24.560
Granny, here's to you.

04:25.760 --> 04:26.600
I want beer.

04:28.160 --> 04:29.680
I'm 72 years old.

04:29.760 --> 04:32.120
I'm old enough to drink.

04:35.880 --> 04:36.960
Half a glass.

04:43.560 --> 04:45.280
Granny, half a glass.

04:47.200 --> 04:48.520
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

04:49.800 --> 04:54.000
Wish you two be happy and in love forever.

04:59.240 --> 05:00.320
Granny.

05:31.640 --> 05:33.840
Why did you drink
when you knew you'd drive?

05:33.920 --> 05:34.960
Where do you live?

05:38.840 --> 05:40.760
FANCY GARDEN

05:45.160 --> 05:50.240
Ready to go, 9.5 kilometers,
around 21 minutes.

05:50.960 --> 05:52.000
We're in the same direction.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.200
Why do you like SUVs?

06:10.920 --> 06:13.920
I love nature and often go
to the outskirts for sketching.

06:14.000 --> 06:16.160
It's more convenient. What about you?

06:17.680 --> 06:21.240
I love nature and often go
to the outskirts for animals.

06:21.320 --> 06:22.160
It's more convenient.

06:24.280 --> 06:25.200
Don't imitate me.

06:26.200 --> 06:27.080
Don't imitate me.

06:30.080 --> 06:31.520
You're definitely drunk.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.800
Why are you staring at me?

06:54.240 --> 06:55.320
You look pretty.

06:55.920 --> 06:57.000
So pretty.

07:09.360 --> 07:11.720
Stop looking at me, or I'll get angry.

07:16.440 --> 07:17.880
You look pretty when you're angry.

07:18.880 --> 07:19.880
So pretty.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.960
Don't be serious with a drunk man.

07:27.640 --> 07:28.920
I'm not drunk.

07:31.000 --> 07:33.120
Okay, you're not drunk.

07:33.200 --> 07:35.200
Don't throw up this time.

07:41.000 --> 07:42.320
I'm not drunk.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.560
I'm just happy.

07:45.880 --> 07:47.280
For what?

07:48.560 --> 07:49.680
I'm happy

07:50.640 --> 07:53.840
because a genius designed

07:53.920 --> 07:56.840
and produced this Tank 300.

07:59.160 --> 08:03.240
Because our brilliant ancestors
invented wine

08:03.320 --> 08:06.320
9,000 years ago.

08:09.680 --> 08:11.680
You're definitely drunk.

08:11.760 --> 08:13.320
You're talking nonsense.

08:16.600 --> 08:17.520
I'm happy because

08:18.880 --> 08:20.440
we both bought

08:21.400 --> 08:22.840
Tank 300.

08:25.400 --> 08:26.920
I'm happy because I got drunk,

08:28.200 --> 08:30.040
got in the wrong car,

08:30.120 --> 08:31.160
and met you.

08:53.920 --> 08:56.080
Turn left, enter the inner road,

08:56.160 --> 08:57.520
and turn left again.

09:06.720 --> 09:08.880
Did you choose the wrong address?

09:08.960 --> 09:09.920
Why are we at my place?

09:11.880 --> 09:12.880
Not wrong.

09:22.720 --> 09:25.360
Drunk man, you're clearly wrong.

09:25.440 --> 09:26.280
Where do you live?

09:28.320 --> 09:29.480
Not wrong.

09:29.560 --> 09:31.360
I'll head home after you get home.

09:33.720 --> 09:35.760
My car will arrive in five minutes.

09:45.080 --> 09:47.200
Are you really sober?

09:50.400 --> 09:51.680
I'm just so happy

09:52.480 --> 09:54.680
that I feel like I'm drunk.

10:06.560 --> 10:08.440
I'm going home. Bye.

10:31.720 --> 10:32.560
Lin Yuan!

10:39.680 --> 10:40.800
Let's be together.

10:44.080 --> 10:45.600
Not for marriage,

10:46.720 --> 10:47.560
just

10:48.560 --> 10:49.920
a relationship.

10:54.400 --> 10:56.440
I thought you wanted to get married.

10:59.760 --> 11:00.760
I do.

11:04.880 --> 11:05.840
However,

11:06.600 --> 11:08.960
is marriage really necessary
for one's life?

11:10.440 --> 11:11.680
Right now,

11:12.520 --> 11:13.520
I just want

11:14.240 --> 11:16.360
to be in a relationship with you,

11:16.440 --> 11:17.440
without thinking about marriage.

11:21.800 --> 11:25.720
It's tiring to be my boyfriend.

11:27.640 --> 11:30.520
I don't believe in love or marriage

11:30.600 --> 11:32.080
or that a relationship can last long.

11:32.160 --> 11:34.000
I love my career more.

11:34.600 --> 11:35.640
Do you like me?

11:54.400 --> 11:55.480
You like me.

12:01.800 --> 12:02.880
Then, it's enough.

12:04.360 --> 12:05.600
Is that enough?

12:18.400 --> 12:19.480
It's enough

12:20.440 --> 12:21.400
for me.

13:03.840 --> 13:04.840
Have you heard?

13:04.920 --> 13:06.360
Mr. Tang is taking a long vacation.

13:07.680 --> 13:09.720
Mr. Tang took a day off,

13:09.800 --> 13:11.480
but I didn't hear
he'd take a long vacation.

13:13.520 --> 13:15.080
Something's wrong with his eyes.

13:15.160 --> 13:16.840
I heard it was serious.

13:16.920 --> 13:19.240
Mr. Zhang from Vandai
was telling the truth.

13:19.320 --> 13:22.000
Will our company be affected?

13:22.880 --> 13:24.760
Where did you get the news?

13:24.840 --> 13:25.920
It must be fake.

13:26.000 --> 13:29.240
I heard it from Lin. It must be real.

13:32.440 --> 13:33.920
We have an advanced medical system.

13:34.000 --> 13:35.400
Even if he's ill, he'll be cured.

13:35.480 --> 13:38.760
Mr. Zhou and Mr. Gu
will take care of everything.

13:38.840 --> 13:40.080
We don't need to worry.

13:57.680 --> 14:00.160
Had I known he was so vulnerable,

14:00.240 --> 14:02.840
I wouldn't have let Quan Shengtang
die in front of him.

14:10.120 --> 14:12.160
TANG QI

14:23.640 --> 14:24.800
Hello.

14:24.880 --> 14:26.200
I went to see a psychiatrist.

14:27.040 --> 14:28.120
What did the doctor say?

14:29.240 --> 14:30.200
The doctor said

14:31.000 --> 14:32.120
a mental issue

14:32.840 --> 14:34.800
should be solved
by psychological treatment.

14:36.920 --> 14:39.000
When Quan Shengtang died by accident,

14:39.080 --> 14:40.240
you were also there.

14:41.120 --> 14:43.080
The doctor told me
to spend more time with you

14:44.400 --> 14:46.120
to adjust my emotion

14:47.280 --> 14:48.280
and restore my eyesight.

14:49.480 --> 14:51.600
The doctor told you

14:51.680 --> 14:54.240
to spend time with me?

14:55.320 --> 14:56.760
It sounds unreliable.

14:57.600 --> 14:59.120
If it's not convenient for you,

14:59.720 --> 15:00.640
you can reject me.

15:01.920 --> 15:03.240
No problem at all.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.360
We don't have much work to do.

15:04.440 --> 15:05.960
I'll take a day off and go to your place.

15:08.680 --> 15:09.640
Thanks.

15:09.720 --> 15:10.840
You're welcome.

15:10.920 --> 15:11.760
The doctor…

15:13.040 --> 15:14.200
told me something else.

15:14.880 --> 15:16.280
Go ahead.

15:16.360 --> 15:17.520
We must cure your eyes.

15:17.600 --> 15:20.040
No matter what it is,
I'll try my best to help you.

15:25.120 --> 15:28.160
I suddenly became blind
at Granny Quan's place.

15:29.600 --> 15:32.040
The doctor also told me
to spend some time with her

15:33.320 --> 15:35.160
to get over it

15:36.040 --> 15:37.240
and restore my eyesight.

15:39.040 --> 15:41.240
But Granny Quan just lost her grandson.

15:42.320 --> 15:44.320
She's also in pain.

15:45.560 --> 15:47.240
How could I ask her for a favor?

15:47.840 --> 15:48.960
Don't worry.

15:49.040 --> 15:50.000
This is for your disease.

15:50.080 --> 15:51.600
Granny Quan will understand.

15:51.680 --> 15:52.920
I'll talk to her.

15:53.720 --> 15:56.560
I can pick her up and go to your place.

16:04.320 --> 16:06.000
You're so kind.

16:17.400 --> 16:20.040
Why did he sound so strange?

16:22.320 --> 16:26.520
The blindness even changed
his personality.

16:35.400 --> 16:37.200
Yuan, I need help.

16:55.880 --> 17:02.320
CASE FORMULATION AND ANALYSIS
IN COUNSELING AND PSYCHOTHERAPY

17:29.760 --> 17:30.640
You're here.

17:47.520 --> 17:49.320
Why did you open the door without asking?

17:49.400 --> 17:50.440
The gate is wide open.

17:50.520 --> 17:51.520
Aren't you afraid of bad buys?

17:53.080 --> 17:54.080
I'm a little slow.

17:54.720 --> 17:55.880
I didn't want you to wait,

17:56.480 --> 17:57.800
so I opened it in advance.

18:01.320 --> 18:02.960
I brought Granny Quan here.

18:04.320 --> 18:06.360
Granny, come in.

18:16.560 --> 18:18.080
He looks pitiful.

18:29.080 --> 18:29.960
Your shoe.

18:30.840 --> 18:31.960
Right here.

18:32.040 --> 18:33.280
- Thank you.
- It's okay.

18:34.720 --> 18:38.760
Granny, sit on the couch.

18:39.320 --> 18:42.880
Don't be polite.
I can take care of myself.

18:46.840 --> 18:47.680
Granny,

18:48.920 --> 18:50.040
your voice

18:50.720 --> 18:52.600
sounds different.

19:00.800 --> 19:03.040
I caught a cold last night.

19:03.120 --> 19:05.080
I'm having a sore throat.

19:10.800 --> 19:12.520
You're not feeling well,

19:13.400 --> 19:14.640
and you came to visit me.

19:16.200 --> 19:17.680
I'm so sorry.

19:17.760 --> 19:19.520
Your eye disease was caused by…

19:21.080 --> 19:22.960
Quan.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.120
I should be responsible.

19:26.400 --> 19:28.040
Don't feel guilty.

19:28.640 --> 19:30.120
As long as you can restore your eyesight,

19:30.200 --> 19:31.960
we're willing to do anything for you.

19:38.240 --> 19:39.120
Doctor

19:40.480 --> 19:41.800
did give me a piece of advice.

19:42.920 --> 19:44.080
What advice?

19:47.840 --> 19:49.760
Real-life desensitization.

19:50.600 --> 19:51.440
Real…

19:54.560 --> 19:56.840
What is real-life desensitization?

19:56.920 --> 19:57.760
What is it?

19:58.560 --> 20:00.360
It's also called quick desensitization.

20:02.600 --> 20:05.160
It's a variation
of systematic desensitization.

20:05.960 --> 20:08.600
Use the actual stimulus
that triggers the reaction

20:09.880 --> 20:11.600
to replace the imagined stimulus.

20:12.560 --> 20:14.120
Accompany the patient

20:15.600 --> 20:19.080
and use a series of situations
to make the patient feel uncomfortable

20:20.560 --> 20:23.680
until the patient is no longer
nervous about or sensitive

20:25.240 --> 20:26.320
to the situations.

20:26.400 --> 20:28.360
Isn't this scene recreation?

20:30.760 --> 20:32.640
The cause of your blindness

20:32.720 --> 20:34.920
is Quan Shengtang's sudden death.

20:35.720 --> 20:37.520
Then it's…

20:58.120 --> 20:59.440
I'm Su Chengcheng.

20:59.520 --> 21:00.840
I'm Tang Qi.

21:00.920 --> 21:02.800
I'm Quan Shengtang.

21:03.400 --> 21:06.200
When I was talking to Tang Qi,
Quan Shengtang came.

21:08.360 --> 21:10.240
He'd been mentally vulnerable

21:10.320 --> 21:12.000
because of his research.

21:13.160 --> 21:14.600
During our conversation,

21:14.680 --> 21:16.280
he was suddenly informed

21:16.360 --> 21:19.440
that he got the research fund
he'd longed for.

21:19.520 --> 21:22.480
Then he was overjoyed
and couldn't stop laughing,

21:22.560 --> 21:26.080
which caused
the stress-induced cardiomyopathy.

21:26.680 --> 21:28.520
Quan Shengtang! Quan Shengtang!

21:28.600 --> 21:29.800
Are you okay?

21:31.040 --> 21:32.080
What happened?

21:32.160 --> 21:33.080
Wake up!

21:33.160 --> 21:35.520
What happened? Wake up!

21:35.600 --> 21:36.880
Quan Shengtang!

21:36.960 --> 21:40.040
If Quan Shengtang and Granny Quan
didn't exist,

21:40.120 --> 21:42.080
how could I have seen

21:42.160 --> 21:45.080
Quan Shengtang and his grandma?

21:45.160 --> 21:46.120
No.

21:48.360 --> 21:49.480
What's wrong?

21:50.240 --> 21:51.200
That day,

21:53.000 --> 21:54.880
Quan Shengtang came from behind me.

22:09.480 --> 22:10.680
Mr. Tang.

22:12.800 --> 22:13.800
Something's wrong.

22:16.040 --> 22:17.360
What's wrong?

22:17.960 --> 22:19.440
Quan Shengtang's voice

22:20.840 --> 22:22.280
wasn't this close to me.

22:25.320 --> 22:26.760
Well, here…

22:26.840 --> 22:28.320
How about this?

22:28.400 --> 22:29.280
Here.

22:29.360 --> 22:30.680
What about now?

22:32.320 --> 22:33.840
And here.

22:40.120 --> 22:41.080
Enough.

22:41.720 --> 22:43.040
That's the right place.

23:00.280 --> 23:01.520
Mr. Tang.

23:06.960 --> 23:07.960
Tang Qi?

23:11.320 --> 23:12.360
Are you okay?

23:15.080 --> 23:16.160
Are you okay?

23:17.080 --> 23:17.960
Tang Qi?

23:22.360 --> 23:23.200
This…

23:25.120 --> 23:27.160
Tang Qi…

23:35.560 --> 23:36.640
Quan Shengtang…

23:40.680 --> 23:41.760
You died…

23:44.840 --> 23:46.080
because of me!

23:47.240 --> 23:48.800
It was an accident.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.200
It's not your fault.

23:50.280 --> 23:54.040
If I hadn't insisted on confronting
you and Su Chengcheng,

23:54.120 --> 23:57.280
you wouldn't have come out to see me

23:57.360 --> 23:59.280
when you didn't want to.

24:01.160 --> 24:02.400
I'm sorry!

24:03.320 --> 24:04.400
I'm sorry!

24:05.040 --> 24:05.960
I'm sorry!

24:06.800 --> 24:07.720
This…

24:08.520 --> 24:10.520
Tang… Tang Qi.

24:10.600 --> 24:12.520
Water… Water…

24:12.600 --> 24:13.600
Water…

24:14.400 --> 24:15.560
Water…

24:16.200 --> 24:17.480
I'll get some water.

24:43.680 --> 24:46.520
Tang Qi, I understand
why you wanted to see me.

24:46.600 --> 24:48.640
It was an accident.

24:48.720 --> 24:50.680
It wasn't your fault.

24:56.840 --> 24:57.880
Water.

25:00.200 --> 25:03.080
Tang Qi, have some water.

25:03.160 --> 25:04.080
Come on.

25:24.280 --> 25:26.760
Have some water.

25:47.720 --> 25:49.000
Who are you?

25:52.880 --> 25:53.840
I…

25:56.520 --> 25:58.560
I'm Su Chengcheng.

26:01.040 --> 26:02.760
Calm down.

26:03.360 --> 26:05.320
This is just acting.

26:14.320 --> 26:15.880
Stop acting.

26:18.000 --> 26:19.160
Get out.

26:20.840 --> 26:21.880
Get out.

26:23.120 --> 26:24.520
Leave my house!

26:27.880 --> 26:28.880
Tang Qi…

26:29.680 --> 26:30.520
Get out!

26:32.640 --> 26:33.720
Get out!

26:37.040 --> 26:38.040
Okay.

26:38.680 --> 26:40.000
We… We're leaving.

26:41.120 --> 26:42.480
Let's go.

26:43.320 --> 26:45.640
Calm down! Don't hurt yourself!

26:46.280 --> 26:47.280
Calm down!

27:36.480 --> 27:39.240
The quick desensitization
didn't work for him.

27:39.320 --> 27:41.400
He didn't get over it
but became more excited.

27:42.480 --> 27:43.880
You should go back first.

27:43.960 --> 27:46.040
I'm a little worried about him.

27:46.120 --> 27:47.440
Even if you're worried,

27:47.520 --> 27:49.000
there's no point
in waiting outside his house.

28:13.000 --> 28:13.880
Stop playing.

28:15.320 --> 28:17.160
Who is the traitor in our company?

28:17.760 --> 28:18.760
We'll find out soon.

28:22.680 --> 28:24.920
They kept an eye on Tang at the fair.

28:25.000 --> 28:26.000
This is…

28:27.520 --> 28:28.880
They've gone too far!

28:30.360 --> 28:31.520
YUAN

28:34.720 --> 28:37.160
I need to take my girlfriend's call.
You can leave.

28:38.800 --> 28:39.840
You…

28:42.000 --> 28:43.480
So cheesy.

28:46.680 --> 28:49.520
- Hello.
- Tang Qi's mental issue is very serious.

28:49.600 --> 28:51.120
He even went crazy

28:52.240 --> 28:54.760
and kicked us out.

28:54.840 --> 28:56.200
Chengcheng is worried about him.

28:56.280 --> 28:58.120
Why don't you come over?

28:58.200 --> 28:59.040
Where are you?

28:59.120 --> 29:02.320
I'm near Tang Qi's house

29:02.400 --> 29:03.360
with Chengcheng.

29:03.440 --> 29:05.120
Okay, I'm coming.

29:14.960 --> 29:16.600
Gu Yu will come here.

29:17.240 --> 29:18.720
Don't be too worried.

29:20.280 --> 29:22.200
If I tell Tang Qi

29:22.280 --> 29:24.680
that Quan Shengtang doesn't exist

29:24.760 --> 29:26.560
and that his death was a show,

29:26.640 --> 29:27.680
will he recover?

29:35.360 --> 29:36.720
Tang Qi is smart.

29:36.800 --> 29:39.440
If he finds out Quan Shengtang is fake,

29:39.520 --> 29:42.120
he'll soon think about
Su Miao and Fang Jin.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.160
What will you do then?

29:44.240 --> 29:45.520
Tell him the truth?

29:47.360 --> 29:49.640
I'm willing to do anything

29:49.720 --> 29:50.800
to cure his eyes.

29:52.800 --> 29:56.400
If he finds out Su Miao, his first love,

29:56.960 --> 29:58.960
and Fang Jin, the girl
he risked his life to protect,

29:59.040 --> 30:00.040
are both fake,

30:00.720 --> 30:02.440
will it drive him crazy?

32:10.520 --> 32:11.920
We've figured it out.

32:14.000 --> 32:15.160
Su Miao,

32:16.800 --> 32:17.800
Fang Jin,

32:19.840 --> 32:20.840
and Quan Shengtang

32:24.200 --> 32:25.480
are all fake.

32:34.400 --> 32:36.440
They are all fake.

32:38.760 --> 32:40.320
This is unbelievable.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.640
In 1917,

32:44.440 --> 32:46.200
the first drone was invented,

32:50.160 --> 32:53.400
but it didn't go public
until decades later.

32:55.360 --> 32:56.920
The spray-on fabric technology

32:57.000 --> 32:59.360
invented by Manel Torres is mature,

33:00.680 --> 33:03.400
but it might take decades
for common people

33:04.920 --> 33:06.880
to wear such clothes.

33:12.400 --> 33:13.520
It seems Su Chengcheng

33:14.040 --> 33:17.320
got a filter product leaked from a lab.

33:23.120 --> 33:25.880
Su Chengcheng fooled me again and again.

33:30.160 --> 33:31.920
But I trusted her

33:34.600 --> 33:37.920
like a fool.

33:41.840 --> 33:43.160
When Su Miao died,

33:46.720 --> 33:48.640
I was heartbroken.

33:52.200 --> 33:53.880
When I fell in love with Fang Jin,

33:57.360 --> 33:59.480
I felt guilty and painful,

34:01.080 --> 34:02.080
like a fool.

34:06.080 --> 34:08.920
I can't believe I cried
for the disappearance

34:09.000 --> 34:10.040
of Fang Jin's

34:12.159 --> 34:13.239
other personality.

34:21.159 --> 34:24.280
I must be the stupidest person
in the world.

34:29.880 --> 34:30.840
You're right.

34:33.040 --> 34:34.800
You were fooled.

34:37.639 --> 34:38.520
However,

34:39.560 --> 34:41.480
perhaps you can view this
from a different angle.

34:46.960 --> 34:48.520
Su Miao, Fang Jin,

34:49.320 --> 34:51.000
and Quan Shengtang,

34:52.080 --> 34:53.880
none of them died.

34:57.080 --> 34:58.080
No matter what,

34:59.120 --> 35:00.160
no death

35:01.040 --> 35:02.840
is the best result.

35:09.880 --> 35:11.480
I'll pick up my girlfriend.

35:12.200 --> 35:13.560
You and Su Chengcheng

35:14.360 --> 35:15.560
should sort this out.

35:54.040 --> 35:55.360
Are you hungry?

36:32.720 --> 36:33.640
Close the net.

36:34.600 --> 36:36.880
TANG QI

36:55.280 --> 36:56.200
I'll go over there.

37:04.640 --> 37:05.920
Did you visit Tang Qi?

37:06.000 --> 37:07.600
Get in. I'll tell you.

37:08.280 --> 37:09.440
Why do I need to get in?

37:11.040 --> 37:12.600
Tang Qi will come out.

37:12.680 --> 37:13.720
Do you want to see him?

37:18.560 --> 37:20.120
What is he coming out?

37:20.200 --> 37:21.440
Does he know Chengcheng is there?

37:22.080 --> 37:24.080
He'll know when he comes out.

37:26.680 --> 37:29.480
Let Tang Qi and Su Chengcheng
sort this out.

37:29.560 --> 37:32.280
Will they be in trouble?

37:34.760 --> 37:37.320
One is smart, and the other is strong.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.280
Someone else will be in trouble.

37:43.440 --> 37:44.520
Fasten the seat belt.

38:52.440 --> 38:53.600
Mr. Gu…

38:53.680 --> 38:56.240
Well, I'm a little tired.

38:56.320 --> 38:58.200
I'm not joining you for dinner.

38:58.280 --> 39:01.120
You must be tired after resting all day.

39:41.400 --> 39:42.480
Slow down.

40:08.440 --> 40:10.000
Here. Your clothes.

40:10.080 --> 40:10.920
Thanks.

40:13.320 --> 40:14.160
LIGHT YELLOW MID-LAYER

40:15.720 --> 40:18.120
4 UNDERPANTS

40:18.200 --> 40:19.400
1 UNDERPANTS

40:58.320 --> 41:01.560
EXPRESS

42:16.880 --> 42:17.840
Su Chengcheng.

42:21.480 --> 42:23.160
How do you know it's me?

42:25.840 --> 42:26.800
I…

42:27.840 --> 42:29.320
I'm just passing by.

42:31.160 --> 42:32.320
Are you okay?

42:35.240 --> 42:36.120
I'm fine.

42:38.280 --> 42:40.360
Where are you going? Let me walk with you.

42:46.360 --> 42:47.920
Go to the park for a stroll.

43:21.160 --> 43:22.160
Tang Qi,

43:23.000 --> 43:25.720
do you have any enemies
or owe anyone money?

43:27.840 --> 43:28.760
I don't have any debt.

43:31.000 --> 43:33.120
Many people are jealous of me.

43:34.080 --> 43:35.600
But I have no enemies.

43:38.840 --> 43:40.560
Then who are they?

43:48.960 --> 43:51.320
Why don't we go this way?

44:01.080 --> 44:03.200
Yes, go straight.

44:03.280 --> 44:04.200
No problem.

44:04.840 --> 44:06.280
There are no obstacles in front.

44:07.000 --> 44:07.840
Yes.

44:19.280 --> 44:21.200
Put the cane away.

44:26.320 --> 44:27.360
What's wrong?

44:28.720 --> 44:29.560
I'm tired.

44:30.600 --> 44:31.520
Tired?

44:33.240 --> 44:34.960
There's a bench. Let's sit there.

45:01.200 --> 45:03.080
I saw them coming this way.

45:03.160 --> 45:04.840
- Where are they?
- They just disappeared.

45:04.920 --> 45:06.360
Go over there, and I'll search this area.

45:11.040 --> 45:12.960
I'll go to the restroom. Wait for me here.

45:13.040 --> 45:14.080
Don't run around.
